+	# eth0. By default this topology cannot keep that split. The plane arms
+	# one conduit and qca-dsa-nss hangs a firmware VLAN interface off that
+	# conduit's interface number, so a port on the other link is host-only;
+	# on the AX5400 the odd link is also GMAC0 (PHY to PHY into port 5),
+	# whose RX is dead in mainline too (openwrt#24696). Put every port on
